project (https://github.com/AlexKontorovich/PrimeNumberTheoremAnd), licensed under
the Apache License 2.0.

vendor/rsbounds/ is copied unchanged from RSBounds (https://github.com/Garald1/RSBounds,
commit 0393b52234b29baf18fbfd02a60a2fca341a5c64), by Harald Andrés Helfgott (with Claude).
The repository is under the MIT License (vendor/rsbounds/LICENSE); many of its files carry
